B.PA=s(["New Daily Mode - everybody gets the same set of songs!","Powers that are available for the Daily mode are Bazinga, Mana, SFTS, Crimzone, and What.","Bumped up version (1.8.0) to accommodate the new Daily mode."],t.s)
